Name     U45B ;
PartNo   00 ;
Date     11/17/26 ;
Revision 02 ;
Designer Todd Houg ;
Company  CADzilla ;
Assembly CADzilla S-100 ACRTC board, rev B ;
Location U45 ;
Device   G16V8MA ;

/* SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-P-2.0 */
